  "_doc": "Food stalls, their trades and the magic Kindling restock (food & items M3, features/food_and_items/04_the_bread_round.md). Embedded like rounds.json/items.json (include_str!), so both hosts and the headless binary get it with no wiring. Pitches resolve against the nav graph by site name (like the taverns and lamp squares), offset a stride so two stalls at one square do not overlap; the bound vendor is whoever the daily round already delivers to that site — no new movement code. Stock is real World.items conjured onto the vendor each Kindling from the trade template; the never-scraped pot conjures a bowl per serving instead. The nightly Watch ledger resets buyer wallets to seed and vendor wallets+stock to the float/template (the confessed placeholder the supply chain, M5, replaces).",
